# No domain yet? Use this file while you test.
#   cp deploy/Caddyfile.http deploy/Caddyfile
# It serves plain HTTP on port 80 — fine on a laptop or a private network, but
# logins travel unencrypted, so do not put real data in it over the internet.
# Once you have a hostname, restore the HTTPS version: cp deploy/Caddyfile.https.example deploy/Caddyfile
:80 {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy api:3001
}
